# --- OngoingProjects/QEC ---
# Source material is not ours to redistribute: Gottesman's 2026 book is an
# unpublished draft from the author's own page. References/README.md indexes what
# is used and says where to get it, and is the only file there that is tracked.
/OngoingProjects/QEC/References/*
!/OngoingProjects/QEC/References/README.md

